# CODEOWNERS
#
# This file defines code ownership for the repository. GitHub automatically
# requests a review from the relevant owner(s) whenever a pull request
# modifies files that match a pattern below.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Patterns follow the same rules as .gitignore. More specific patterns take
# precedence over less specific ones.
#
# Documentation:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Global owners
# Default fallback for any file not explicitly covered below
* @homelab-alpha

# Infrastructure, CI/CD, and Repository Config
# Management of GitHub-specific automation and repo settings
